WEBVTT

00:00:00.595 --> 00:00:02.882
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> a, 3

00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:05.324
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m hungry.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:07.682
Time for lunch.

00:00:10.229 --> 00:00:12.476
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b, 1

00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:14.469
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m tired.

00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:16.570
Time for bed.

00:00:18.615 --> 00:00:21.058
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> c, 2

00:00:22.115 --> 00:00:23.215
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m cold.

00:00:24.289 --> 00:00:26.257
It’s five degrees this morning.

00:00:28.382 --> 00:00:30.762
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> d, 5

00:00:32.006 --> 00:00:33.514
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m thirsty.

00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:36.598
I need a glass of water.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.929
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> e, 4

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.087
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I’m hot.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:46.235
It’s thirty-five degrees!